<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have seized a major town in eastern DRC, breaking a ceasefire and intensifying fighting with the Congolese army, while ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province and an ISIL affiliate sustains itself through conflict gold. A drone strike hit Bunyakiri hospital, forcing MSF to move 76 patients, and a Chinese national was abducted and two people were killed in an ambush at Kalemie. Rwanda’s foreign minister says the US has an unbalanced approach to the DR Congo deal and the US has imposed sanctions on Rwanda for alleged support to rebels. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/19/uk-eu-talks-asylum-seekers-third-country-hubs&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/t%C3%AAte-%C3%A0-t%C3%AAte/20261119-us-has-unbalanced-approach-on-dr-congo-deal-rwanda-s-foreign-minister-says&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNM0pnNDhHc0djU1FuRTROYW1nSEtfWGRaRTJUZ1VYUkFfQzJuMUJtZzZ0NnJtUklKX2F6eUtPOXNBY1NQalNoTjRkd2Z5VGRhWUdPTHZjM01yMVkyMDNVTEk4ZmhEaG94aV9qWUtNdXowNHJ4Rk1TN0kyN2ZzSGJCUWlrb1BWcDFMa0FESWRuYkJLS2xwcHJwUWZNVTlrNXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;KT PRESS -&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBEOEFNMWlIWFh1UEc2aEw3R2RJMnJJZUpUREVrV0Y4V1ctdU1PbWlwV3RNdXVhS25MNTJBTjhzZDlqQmF5eERWdWdST196VVhwdTlCbnVDTGFNMHFkclBaUk5QcERyYTFyRE00U1FKMlJIVGJ0VThGblB3Tks?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taarifa Rwanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiu